  "editorial": [
    "This rehearsal joins the first verse to a single chorus ending at Last. The chorus’s first and second endings, second text and D.S. route belong to a separate longer reading.",
    "The verse changes to three flats at the segno and returns to C at the chorus. Pitches include the written accidentals. Three half-bar measures are retained at the piano pickup and around the verse-to-chorus boundary.",
    "Both piano staves sound throughout. Separate tracks carry the independently stemmed bass and treble lines. The guide follows the single sung line and the lower ad lib reading of the chorus.",
    "Tempo and velocities are fixed for rehearsal. The bass rolls sound together and fermatas keep nominal lengths. The MIDI carries no lyrics or scan images."
  ],
